  {
    "hotel_id": "1023680",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/taipei-discover-hostel/hotel/taipei-tw.html",
    "name": "Taipei Discover Hostel",
    "detail": "I stayed at the hostel for almost 2 weeks to deal for family reason. This is one of the best, if not the best, I’ve stayed thus far. It provides high standard hardware such as heated toilet seat, comfort social area…. etc. In your private bunk bed, it has a ventilation that vacuum air from outside to provide fresh air. Once you close the curtin, you have completely privacy. I notice that the operator has put a lot of thoughts into the hostel. To name a few good design, there is a custom made small desk that you can write on, there is floor light that you can turn on when it’s late, soundproof is pretty good, the social area is the most comfortable place. I can’t say enough good thing about this hostel. I have stayed in a number of hostel in taipei and this is a good place. I see on the other post that attacks this hostel. It’s pathetic and makes me upset when people intensively badmouth this place. I suggest all of you to check it out and see with your own eyes. Truth has and always will prevail over the forces of the evil.",
