  {
    "hotel_id": "2460842",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/five-elements-hostel-taipei/hotel/taipei-tw.html",
    "name": "Xiao Jiaoluo Corner Hostel & Cafe",
    "detail": "A great place to stay. I chose this place because it is very near the Taiwan Expo where the Fancy Frontier (Anime, cosplay and game event) took place this Feb. 16-17. Also it is very near Yuanshan mrt station if you want to visit nearby places in Taipei. Shilin Night market is just a station away (Jiantan station) from Yuanshan station. Convenience stores and restaurants are also nearby. They'll leave your keys in the mailbox if you are checking in past the reception hour. The room is quiet and clean. I love their locker, it is spacious enough to store things I brought along with me. Bathroom is shared and clean. The staff are really nice and can be approached easily for assistance. They can speak and understand English so no worries. And after checking out, you may leave your luggage if you still plan to go to other places or your flight is on evening. You can claim your luggage until 10pm only. I'll definitely stay here again the next time I attend Taiwan Fancy Frontier event.",
